.env file for Akoben Backend

Do not commit this file to GitHub!

Arkesel API Key for sending SMS

ARKESEL_API_KEY=your_arkesel_api_key_here

Yahoo Account used to SEND the notification emails (and receive them)

EMAIL_USER=nyogyasi@yahoo.com

16-character Yahoo App Password (NOT your regular password)

To get this: Go to Yahoo Account Security -> External Connections -> Generate App Password

EMAIL_PASS=your_16_char_yahoo_app_password

The email address where Counsel (Nana Yaw Gyasi) will RECEIVE the notifications

COUNSEL_EMAIL=nyogyasi@yahoo.com

PORT=10000